%% alt: Two flows. Indexing: SharePoint, the policy library and the wiki feed a change feed; documents are parsed, chunked and given context, embedded, and stored in a hybrid index with access lists. Answering: a staff member signs in to the assistant API; the question passes input checks and a small-model rewrite, then hybrid search over the index filtered by the user's groups, a reranker from 50 to 4 passages, and the answer model through the AI gateway; a citation and grounding check runs before the answer returns, and traces, feedback and eval samples are kept.
flowchart TB
  subgraph Q[Answering, per question]
    U[Staff member]:::human -->|SSO| APP[Assistant API]:::tool
    APP --> IG[Input checks]:::control --> QR[Query rewrite<br/>small model]:::model
    QR --> HS[Hybrid search<br/>BM25 + vectors,<br/>filtered by user's groups]:::tool
    HS --> RR[Reranker<br/>top 50 → 4]:::model --> GW[AI gateway]:::control
    GW --> LLM[Answer model<br/>streams with citations]:::model --> OG[Citation and<br/>grounding check]:::control
  end
  subgraph IX[Indexing, on change]
    SRC[(SharePoint, policy<br/>library, wiki)]:::untrusted --> ING[Change feed<br/>parse, chunk,<br/>add context]:::tool --> EMB[Embed]:::model --> IDX[(Hybrid index<br/>with ACLs)]:::data
  end
  IDX --> HS
  OG -.->|answer| U
  OG --> TEL[(Traces, feedback,<br/>eval samples)]:::data
